.TH MC-TUI 1 "November 2026" "mc-tui 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mc-tui \- Fast and lightweight Terminal UI Minecraft Launcher for local files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mc-tui
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mc-tui
is a zero-dependency, lightweight Terminal User Interface (TUI) Minecraft launcher
designed specifically for discovering and launching local Minecraft files without
requiring external accounts or online telemetry.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-game\-dir \fIDIR\fR
Specify Minecraft root directory (default: ~/.minecraft or configured path).
.TP
.B \-\-list
List all locally installed Minecraft versions and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-launch \fIVERSION_ID\fR
Directly launch a specified version without opening the interactive TUI.
.TP
.B \-\-username \fINAME\fR
Override player username for launch.
.TP
.B \-\-ram \fISIZE\fR
Override maximum RAM allocation (e.g. 4G, 8G).
.TP
.B \-\-preview \fIVERSION_ID\fR
Print the generated Java launch command for \fIVERSION_ID\fR and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-download\-list
List official Minecraft versions available for download from Mojang.
.TP
.B \-\-download \fIVERSION_ID\fR
Download official vanilla Minecraft version (client JAR, libraries, and assets).
.TP
.B \-\-snapshots
Include snapshots and pre-releases when listing versions with \-\-download\-list.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-assets
Skip downloading asset files (sounds, textures, music) with \-\-download.
.TP
.B \-\-mirror \fI{official,bmclapi}\fR
Select download mirror source ('official' or 'bmclapi').
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH TUI KEYBINDINGS
.TP
.B 1, 2, 3, 4, 5
Switch between Versions, Settings, Console, Directory Picker, and Download tabs.
.TP
.B d
Jump directly to Vanilla Downloader tab (from Versions view).
.TP
.B Tab
Cycle to next tab.
.TP
.B Arrow Keys / j, k
Navigate list items or settings fields.
.TP
.B Enter
Launch selected version or edit setting field.
.TP
.B p
Preview Java launch command for selected version.
.TP
.B /
Filter versions by name.
.TP
.B r
Refresh version list or reset settings.
.TP
.B s
Save configuration.
.TP
.B q
Quit application.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/mc-tui/config.json
.RS
User configuration file.
.RE
.SH AUTHOR
mc-tui was created by heaway.
